{"seq":1,"slug":"corpus-type-taxonomy-balance","title":"语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/corpus-type-taxonomy-balance","wordCount":2925,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型\">语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型</h1><p>建语料库最难的一步发生在你写下第一个字之前：决定<strong>把哪些文本按什么比例放进来的</strong>。一部 1 亿词的语料库如果 95% 是新闻，它对「口语虚词分布」这类问题是盲的；一部只收书面语的库会把 <code>gonna</code>、<code>ain&#39;t</code> 这类高频口语变体整体漏掉。本文讨论的正是这个前置环节——语料库如何按类型分层、如何定义「代表性」（representativeness）与「平衡」（balance），以及抽样配额该怎么算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语料库设计的三个基础属性常被混为一谈，需要先拆开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代表性（representativeness）</strong>：库中的语言样本能否推广到某个<strong>目标总体</strong>（target population）的统计行为。Biber 在 1993 年的经典论文里把它定义为「样本相对于目标总体的程度」，并强调目标总体必须先被明确界定——是「20 世纪美式英语书面语」还是「全球商务邮件」，直接决定抽样框架（framing）完全不同（Biber, <em>Representativeness in corpus design</em>, Literary and Linguistic Computing 8(4):243–257, 1993）。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡（balance）</strong>：各类文本在库中的<strong>比例分配</strong>是否与设计意图一致。平衡是手段，代表性是目的；比例均衡不等于代表目标总体。</li>\n<li><strong>抽样框架（sampling frame）</strong>：可枚举、可从中抽取样本的文本清单（报刊目录、ISBN 列表、域名表、录音清单）。没有它，代表性无从定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[界定目标总体&lt;br/&gt;语言/时间/地域/媒介] --&gt; B[构建抽样框架&lt;br/&gt;可枚举文本清单]&#10;  B --&gt; C[选择分层维度&lt;br/&gt;媒介 领域 语域]&#10;  C --&gt; D[确定配额分配&lt;br/&gt;比例式 or 等量式]&#10;  D --&gt; E[抽取文本样本&lt;br/&gt;控制单篇长度上限]&#10;  E --&gt; F[判据检验&lt;br/&gt;稳定性 覆盖率]&#10;  F --&gt;|未达标| C&#10;  F --&gt;|达标| G[冻结设计&lt;br/&gt;记录设计说明]\">graph TD\n  A[界定目标总体&lt;br/&gt;语言/时间/地域/媒介] --&gt; B[构建抽样框架&lt;br/&gt;可枚举文本清单]\n  B --&gt; C[选择分层维度&lt;br/&gt;媒介 领域 语域]\n  C --&gt; D[确定配额分配&lt;br/&gt;比例式 or 等量式]\n  D --&gt; E[抽取文本样本&lt;br/&gt;控制单篇长度上限]\n  E --&gt; F[判据检验&lt;br/&gt;稳定性 覆盖率]\n  F --&gt;|未达标| C\n  F --&gt;|达标| G[冻结设计&lt;br/&gt;记录设计说明]</pre><p>分层维度不是越多越好，而是要看<strong>哪个维度最可能让语言行为分叉</strong>。Biber 的语域变异研究反复证明：媒介（口语/书面）与语域（register）对词汇、句法分布的解释力，往往远大于主题领域（domain）。这引出一个反直觉结论——<strong>按主题均衡采样未必提高代表性，除非主题恰好对应语言变体</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>失败时的症状</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代表性</td>\n<td>能否外推到目标总体</td>\n<td>结论只对库内成立</td>\n<td>拿新闻库谈口语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平衡</td>\n<td>各类比例是否按设计</td>\n<td>某类压倒性主导</td>\n<td>把「均衡」当「全面」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽样框架</td>\n<td>从哪个清单抽取</td>\n<td>抽样偏置不可见</td>\n<td>用便利样本冒充框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同质性</td>\n<td>单篇内部是否稳定</td>\n<td>单篇拉偏整体分布</td>\n<td>长文档未截断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语料库类型的分类维度与主流谱系\">语料库类型的分类维度与主流谱系</h2><p>&quot;语料库类型&quot;是一组正交维度的组合，而非单一标签。设计时至少要在一张维度表上给每个库定位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值谱</th>\n<th>代表语料库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>媒介</td>\n<td>书面 / 口语 / 多模态</td>\n<td>BNC（90% 书面 + 10% 口语，1 亿词，1994）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>共时 / 历时 / 监测型</td>\n<td>COCA（1990–2019，约 10 亿词）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>单语 / 双语 / 多语平行</td>\n<td>Europarl、OPUS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样方式</td>\n<td>静态冻结 / 动态增长</td>\n<td>NOW Corpus（News on the Web，持续增长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域</td>\n<td>通用 / 专门领域</td>\n<td>GENIA（生物医学 MEDLINE 摘要）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>媒介来源</td>\n<td>印刷 / 网络 / 转写</td>\n<td>TenTen 系列（网络爬取）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>静态冻结</strong>库（BNC、Brown）保证可复现：同一查询十年后返回同一数字，代价是无法反映语言变化。<strong>监测型</strong>库（NOW、TenTen）持续扩增以追踪新词漂移，代价是版本间不可直接对比。<strong>历时</strong>库（COCA）通过固定每期配额把时间维度做成可比结构——每年约 2000 万词的等量抽样，让「逐年趋势」可解释（<a href=\"https://www.english-corpora.org/coca/\">English-Corpora.org</a>）。</p>\n<p>分类还牵涉一个反复出现的概念混淆：<strong>语域（register）、体裁（genre）、文本类型（text type）、领域（domain）不是同义词</strong>。Lee 在 2001 年专门撰文厘清：register 是情境驱动的语言变体，genre 是文化约定的文本类别，text type 是<strong>语言学上</strong>（词汇/句法特征）聚类的结果——一个 genre 里可能混着多个 text type（Lee, <em>Genres, Registers, Text Types, Domains, and Styles</em>, Language Learning &amp; Technology 5(3), 2001）。把「新闻」当成同质层，就会忽视其内部社论、简讯、特写的句法差异。Sinclair 的设计指南给出的默认建议是先广后细（Sinclair, <em>Corpus and Text — Basic Principles</em>, in <em>Developing Linguistic Corpora</em>, 2005）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代表性-从抽样理论到稳定性判据\">代表性：从抽样理论到稳定性判据</h2><p>代表性可以被写成抽样理论里一个熟悉的问题。设目标总体被划分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 个层（stratum），第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 层有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个文本单元，层内语言特征方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。要在总样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 下最小化估计量的方差，<strong>Neyman 最优分配</strong>给出每层应抽的样本数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h = n \\cdot \\frac{N_h \\sigma_h}{\\sum_{k=1}^{H} N_k \\sigma_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5313em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条公式给出一个反直觉结论：<strong>样本应向「内部变异大」的层倾斜</strong>，而非按层大小机械分配。口语层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往极大，其库中占比常被刻意抬高——BNC 的口语实际权重就高于其在真实语言使用中的占比。</p>\n<p>分歧在于：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 事先未知。Biber 的做法是<strong>迭代式</strong>的——先小规模试抽，用观测到的层内方差估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再调整配额，直到新增样本不再显著改变目标特征的分布，即达到「<strong>稳定性判据</strong>」（stability criterion）。对于类型（type）而非词符（token）的估计，标准误近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SE}(\\hat{p}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它说明：侦测占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的低频现象时，样本量须随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 减小而急剧上升——把标准误压到一半，样本量要翻四倍。这界定了**「能做哪些问题」的边界**：100 万词的库无法可靠支持「低频构式的跨语域对比」，因为目标现象每层可能只出现个位数次。</p>\n<p>工程上把这条判据落成两条检查：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>留出验证集</strong>：保留一部分文本不进库，检验库内分布能否预测留出分布；偏差大即代表性不足。</li>\n<li><strong>饱和度分析（saturation）</strong>：按随机顺序逐步加入样本文本，绘制新类型增长率曲线。曲线趋平说明该维度接近穷尽；持续线性上升说明还有未覆盖的层。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Atkins、Clear 与 Ostler 1992 年的设计准则把这一思路总结为「设计先于采集」四问：目标、总体、来源、数量（Atkins, Clear &amp; Ostler, <em>Corpus Design Criteria</em>, Literary and Linguistic Computing 7(1):1–16, 1992），至今仍是设计评审清单的骨架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平衡性设计-配额-加权与低频现象\">平衡性设计：配额、加权与低频现象</h2><p>配额分配有两种基本策略，选错会让库的目标失效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分配策略</th>\n<th>每层配额</th>\n<th>适合的命题</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>比例式（proportional）</td>\n<td>与层在总体的占比成正比</td>\n<td>估计总体语言使用的真实分布</td>\n<td>小层被淹没，低频变体消失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等量式（equal / disproportional）</td>\n<td>每层固定相同数量</td>\n<td>层间<strong>对比</strong>（各语域是否不同）</td>\n<td>合计分布不代表真实使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中常<strong>混合使用</strong>：为描述整体分布用比例权重，为语域对比额外超采小层，并在元数据中明确记录「采集权重」与「分析权重」两套数字。分析时若用等量样本估计总体占比，必须做<strong>后分层加权</strong>（post-stratification weighting），否则把超采层的比例误当成真实比例。</p>\n<p>平衡性设计还有一个隐蔽陷阱：<strong>单篇长度不设上限</strong>。如果一层的文本平均长度是另一层的十倍，即使「篇数」均衡，「词数」也会严重失衡，且长文本会把自身内部的语言习惯过度注入。标准做法是<strong>截断</strong>（truncation）——每篇只取固定长度（如 2000 词）。Brown Corpus 就是每篇 2000 词、共 500 篇（Kučera &amp; Francis, 1967）；ICE 的设计同样以 2000 词为一篇、每类 500 篇（spoken 300 篇 + written 200 篇），让不同层的可比性建立在一个共同的长度单位上（<a href=\"http://ice-corpora.net/ice/design.htm\">International Corpus of English</a>）。</p>\n<p>低频现象的损失是 Zipf 分布的直接后果：最高频的少数词占据大部分词符，大量类型只出现一两次（hapax legomena）。小库天然丢失长尾，而长尾恰是词典学、形态学与方言研究最关心的部分。缓解手段有三条：对目标现象定向超采、合并外部库补齐长尾、或明确声明库的能力边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络与生成式时代的再设计\">网络与生成式时代的再设计</h2><p><strong>从&quot;可枚举框架&quot;到&quot;可爬取总体&quot;</strong>。Kilgarriff 与 Grefenstette 在 2003 年提出「网络即语料库」，把网页当作规模近乎无限的文本来源（<em>Introduction to the Special Issue on the Web as Corpus</em>, Computational Linguistics 29(3):333–347, 2003）。但网页不是可枚举清单，而是搜索引擎结果的切片，缺失可定义的抽样框架。网络库的设计重心因此从「配额」转向<strong>去偏与元数据</strong>——按域名、国家、语言标签分层，剔除模板页与镜像，公开爬取与清洗流程。</p>\n<p><strong>监测型网络库成为主流</strong>。GloWbE 汇集 20 国网络英语约 19 亿词（2013），NOW 库自 2010 年起持续收录在线新闻、按月递增（<a href=\"https://www.english-corpora.org/now/\">English-Corpora.org</a>）。它们让「新词传播速度」第一次可测，代价是版本漂移——引用时必须带快照日期。</p>\n<p><strong>LLM 预训练把语料设计推到万亿词规模</strong>，核心矛盾没变。The Pile（EleutherAI，约 825 GiB、22 个来源域）、Dolma（AllenAI，约 3T token）、FineWeb（Hugging Face，约 15T token，源自 Common Crawl）等开放数据集都把**域配比（data mixture）**写成显式超参——这是比例式配额在大规模上的重演，另加两项经典语料库没有的工序：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>去重（deduplication）</strong>：跨文档近似去重显著改善模型表现（Lee et al., <em>Deduplicating Training Data Makes Language Models Better</em>, ACL 2022）。重复文档等于对某些文本施加了未经声明的隐性超采权重，直接破坏「平衡」。</li>\n<li><strong>质量过滤</strong>：按困惑度、启发式规则或分类器打分剔除低质文本，把「单篇代表性」的判据前移到了采集阶段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>监管层面也把语料设计从技术问题变成合规问题：欧盟《数字化单一市场版权指令》(EU) 2019/790 第 3、4 条区分科研目的的文本与数据挖掘（TDM）例外与可被权利人保留的通用例外；《人工智能法案》(EU) 2024/1689 第 53 条要求通用目的 AI 模型提供者公开训练数据摘要。语料库元数据（来源、许可、保留权声明）因此从「良好实践」变成「设计必须项」。</p>\n<p>实践含义是：<strong>把代表性判据、配额与采集权重、去重与过滤规则、许可与保留声明，全部写进一份可版本化的「设计说明」</strong>。它本身是语料库的一部分——没有它，结论无法复现，也无法合规审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代表性、平衡、抽样框架是三件独立的事：平衡是手段，代表性是目的，框架是前提。界定不清目标总体，配额计算都是空中楼阁。</li>\n<li>分层维度应按「语言行为是否分叉」来选；register / genre / text type / domain 不是同义词，混淆会导致层内不同质。</li>\n<li>Neyman 最优分配把样本推向<strong>层内方差大</strong>的层；稳定性判据与饱和度曲线是判断「采够没有」的可操作工具。</li>\n<li>比例式与等量式配额服务于不同命题，混用时必须显式记录采集权重与分析权重，并对长文本做截断。</li>\n<li>网络库与 LLM 预训练延续同一套逻辑，只是把权重、去重、合规声明变成了显式的一等公民。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型","id":"语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语料库类型的分类维度与主流谱系","id":"语料库类型的分类维度与主流谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性：从抽样理论到稳定性判据","id":"代表性-从抽样理论到稳定性判据"},{"level":2,"text":"平衡性设计：配额、加权与低频现象","id":"平衡性设计-配额-加权与低频现象"},{"level":2,"text":"网络与生成式时代的再设计","id":"网络与生成式时代的再设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/sampling-frame-stratified-collection"}}